      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Potential Build Error: Missing `\u003cunistd.h\u003e`**\nWhile pruning unused C-headers was a good step, `getopt` and `optarg` are POSIX functions defined in `\u003cunistd.h\u003e` (or `\u003cgetopt.h\u003e`). Since you are using `getopt` here, you should explicitly `#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e` at the top of `iaptool.cc` to guarantee it compiles reliably across different environments, as it may no longer be transitively included.",
